    "engine": "jupyter",
    "markdown": "---\ngd-head-tags:\n  - >-\n    `<script type=\"application/ld+json\">[{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"SoftwareSourceCode\", \"name\": \"EdgeCase\", \"description\":\n    \"High-performance graph analysis library\", \"codeRepository\":\n    \"https://github.com/rich-iannone/edgecase\", \"license\":\n    \"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\", \"url\":\n    \"https://rich-iannone.github.io/edgecase\", \"documentation\":\n    \"https://rich-iannone.github.io/edgecase\", \"programmingLanguage\": {\"@type\":\n    \"ComputerLanguage\", \"name\": \"Python\"}}, {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"name\": \"project - EdgeCase\", \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\":\n    \"WebSite\", \"name\": \"EdgeCase\"}, \"url\":\n    \"https://rich-iannone.github.io/edgecase/reference/project.html\"}]</script>`{=html}\nopen-graph:\n  title: >-\n    [project()]{.doc-object-name .doc-function .doc-label .doc-label-function} |\n    EdgeCase\n  description: The tasks in opening a café, and the order they must be done in.\ntwitter-card:\n  title: >-\n    [project()]{.doc-object-name .doc-function .doc-label .doc-label-function} |\n    EdgeCase\n  description: The tasks in opening a café, and the order they must be done in.\ntitle: >-\n  [project()]{.doc-object-name .doc-function .doc-label .doc-label-function}\nbody-classes: doc-api-page doc-py-api-page\nshift-heading-level-by: 0\nbread-crumbs: false\ntoc-depth: 3\ndescription-meta: >-\n  The tasks in opening a café, and the order they must be done in.\npage-navigation: false\nhtml-table-processing: none\n---\n\n::: {.doc-subject}\n\nThe tasks in opening a café, and the order they must be done in.\n:::\n\n::: {.doc-usage-source}\nUsage\n\n[Source](https://github.com/rich-iannone/edgecase/blob/main/python/edgecase/example_networks.py#L1591-L1664){target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"}\n:::\n\n::: {.doc-signature .doc-function}\n```pythonsignature\nproject()\n```\n:::\n\n::: {.doc-text}\n\nThe project plan for opening a made-up café, from signing the lease to the soft opening,\nwith an edge from each task to every task that can't start until it's done. The graph is a\ndirected acyclic graph (DAG), and each edge is weighted by the days the first task takes,\nso the longest path from `\"Start\"` to `\"Finish\"` is the critical path: the chain of tasks\nthat sets how soon the café can open, where any delay delays the opening.\n\nNetwork Properties:\n\n- 16 nodes (14 tasks, and the milestones `\"Start\"` and `\"Finish\"`, labeled by name)\n- 20 edges (from a task to a task that depends on it)\n- Directed, acyclic, weighted by the days the first task takes\n\nNode Attributes:\n\n- `days`: how many days the task takes (`0` for the milestones)\n- `owner`: who is responsible for it, `\"Rosa\"`, `\"Theo\"`, `\"Imani\"` or `\"Kenji\"` (missing\n  for the milestones)\n- `pos`: an `(x, y)` position for drawing the plan left to right, with the critical path\n  along the middle\n\nEdge Attributes:\n\n- `days`: how many days the first task takes, the same as the edge weight\n\nWhat to Look For:\n\n- **A 66-day critical path.** The longest path runs from signing the lease through the\n  design, the permits, the build-out, installing the equipment and training the staff to\n  the soft opening, and takes 66 days. `dag_longest_path()` finds it.\n- **Slack elsewhere.** Every task off the critical path can slip without delaying the\n  opening: ordering the equipment by up to 20 days, the health inspection by 2, and\n  hiring staff by 42.\n- **Nine stages.** The topological generations put the tasks in 9 stages, each of which\n  can start once the one before it is done.\n- **Bottlenecks.** Every path from the start to installing the equipment goes through the\n  design, its immediate dominator, and every path to the soft opening through signing\n  the lease.\n:::\n\n## Returns {.doc-returns}\n\n::: {.doc-definition-items}\n<code> [Graph]{.doc-parameter-annotation}</code>\n\n:   The project plan.\n:::\n\n## Examples {.doc-examples}\n\nFind the critical path and draw it on the plan:\n\n::: {#9b1bc22f .cell execution_count=1}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nimport edgecase as ec\n\nproject = ec.project()\ncritical = project.dag_longest_path()\n\nproject.plot(\n    layout=\"pos\", highlight=critical, label_by=\"label\", height=360\n)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=1}\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"ec-theme\" style=\"display:contents\"><style class=\"ec-theme-vars\">:where(.ec-theme){--ect-3239c383:#fafafa;--ect-e5dfd507:#94a3b8;--ect-8a2de1d4:#374151;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(15,23,42,0.88);--ect-21ade003:#f1f5f9;--ect-61169ea5:#c2410c;--ect-63cc1385:#d4d4d8;--ect-879b7ebc:#949497;--ect-b9f8de6d:#872d08;--ect-f59ba8df:#a1a1aa}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){.ec-theme{--ect-3239c383:#0d1117;--ect-e5dfd507:#4b5563;--ect-8a2de1d4:#d1d5db;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(241,245,249,0.92);--ect-21ade003:#0f172a;--ect-61169ea5:#f97316;--ect-63cc1385:#3f3f46;--ect-879b7ebc:#2c2c31;--ect-b9f8de6d:#ae500f;--ect-f59ba8df:#71717a}}:is(html.quarto-light, body.quarto-light, html[data-bs-theme=\"light\"], [data-jp-theme-light=\"true\"], body.vscode-light, body.vscode-high-contrast-light, html[theme=\"light\"]) .ec-theme{--ect-3239c383:#fafafa;--ect-e5dfd507:#94a3b8;--ect-8a2de1d4:#374151;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(15,23,42,0.88);--ect-21ade003:#f1f5f9;--ect-61169ea5:#c2410c;--ect-63cc1385:#d4d4d8;--ect-879b7ebc:#949497;--ect-b9f8de6d:#872d08;--ect-f59ba8df:#a1a1aa}:is(html.quarto-dark, body.quarto-dark, html[data-bs-theme=\"dark\"], [data-jp-theme-light=\"false\"], body.vscode-dark, body.vscode-high-contrast:not(.vscode-high-contrast-light), html[theme=\"dark\"]) .ec-theme{--ect-3239c383:#0d1117;--ect-e5dfd507:#4b5563;--ect-8a2de1d4:#d1d5db;--ect-57425a7e:rgba(241,245,249,0.92);--ect-21ade003:#0f172a;--ect-61169ea5:#f97316;--ect-63cc1385:#3f3f46;--ect-879b7ebc:#2c2c31;--ect-b9f8de6d:#ae500f;--ect-f59ba8df:#71717a}</style><div class=\"ec-plot